### 1. No API key → 401
GET http://localhost:8080/patients

### 2. All patients
GET http://localhost:8080/patients
X-Api-Key: dev-key

### 3. Search by name
GET http://localhost:8080/patients?q=binti
X-Api-Key: dev-key

### 4. One patient
GET http://localhost:8080/patients/2
X-Api-Key: dev-key

### 5. Find by IC
GET http://localhost:8080/patients/by-ic/850612-10-1234
X-Api-Key: dev-key

### 6. Not found → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/patients/999
X-Api-Key: dev-key

### 7. Create → 201
POST http://localhost:8080/patients
X-Api-Key: dev-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Siti Hajar binti Musa",
  "no_kp": "880909-01-2222",
  "telefon": "0133334444"
}

### 8. Bad data → 422 (Malay messages!)
POST http://localhost:8080/patients
X-Api-Key: dev-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "",
  "no_kp": "123"
}

### 9. Unknown URL → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/doctors
X-Api-Key: dev-key